              "question": "Match each measurement to the meter and how it is connected.",
              "correctAnswer": "slot-current:series-ammeter,slot-voltage:parallel-voltmeter",
              "explanation": "Current is measured by joining the meter into the path, voltage by connecting across the component.",
              "metadata": {
                "version": 1,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "id": "series-ammeter",
